01:06:16.220 --> 01:06:16.660
Totally.

1714
01:06:16.900 --> 01:06:18.300
The editors are amazing.

1715
01:06:18.300 --> 01:06:20.000
We had fantastic editors.

1716
01:06:20.400 --> 01:06:21.240
This one was Dean.

1717
01:06:22.180 --> 01:06:26.900
Dave Rogers, as you know, I'm still working with, work with them all the time.

1718
01:06:27.140 --> 01:06:27.340
Brilliant.

1719
01:06:29.060 --> 01:06:29.880
Claire Scanlon.

1720
01:06:29.900 --> 01:06:30.740
Claire Scanlon.

1721
01:06:30.940 --> 01:06:31.560
Also brilliant.

1722
01:06:33.640 --> 01:06:42.020
And there was enormous amounts of leeway for the editors and in post because like a documentary,

1723
